{"id":5367,"date":"2025-04-30T12:47:31","date_gmt":"2025-04-30T19:47:31","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/penserra.com\/?p=5367"},"modified":"2025-05-30T07:04:26","modified_gmt":"2025-05-30T14:04:26","slug":"penserra-celebrates-asian-pacific-american-heritage-month-3","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/penserra.com\/penserra-celebrates-asian-pacific-american-heritage-month-3\/","title":{"rendered":"Penserra Celebrates Asian Pacific American Heritage Month"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Penserra proudly celebrates Asian Pacific American Heritage month, honoring the contributions and influence Asian Americans and Pacific Islander Americans have made to the history, culture, and achievements of the United States and are instrumental to its future success.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-pullquote alignleft\"><blockquote><p>The diverse Asian American and Pacific Islander American population includes members of more than 30 ethnic groups who speak more than 300 languages and dialects.<\/p><\/blockquote><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>The theme of this year&#8217;s Heritage Month is <strong>&#8220;A Legacy of Leadership and Resilience.&#8221;<\/strong> The 2025 theme is a continuation of the &#8220;Advancing Leaders&#8221; series that began in 2021 and focuses on leadership and engagement to advance the Asian American and Pacific Islander (AAPI) community. One of the reasons May was chosen for this celebration was to pay tribute to the first Japanese immigrants who came to the United States in May 1843.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Asian Americans and Pacific Islanders have a rich heritage thousand of years old and have both shaped the history of the United States and had their lives dramatically influenced by moments in its history.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Penserra proudly celebrates Asian Pacific American Heritage month, honoring the contributions and influence Asian Americans and Pacific Islander Amer